integration_type.description:
A number indicating the type of integration this metadata is for. 1 indicates Slack;
7 indicates Microsoft Teams;
8 indicates Jira.

status.description:
A number indicating the status of this integration metadata. 0 indicates unknown;
1 indicates pending; 2 indicates complete; 3 indicates manually created;
4 indicates manually updated; 5 indicates failed.

RumExclusionFilterUpdateAttributes.description:
The attributes of an exclusion filter that can be updated.
For the built-in Error Tracking exclusion filter, only `enabled` can be set;
`name`, `event_type`, and `query` must be omitted.
